 "entity_note": "ATC-mapped CHEMBL6066864 'FLUPENTIXOL' carries no structure and no activities. The benchmark record's CAS (53772-82-0) identifies the cis(Z) isomer (P28.1), which is ChEMBL CHEMBL54661 'Z-FLUPENTIXOL' and GtoPdb ligand 948. The Lundbeck FLUANXOL product monograph (Canada) states commercial flupentixol dihydrochloride is an approximately 1:1 cis:trans mixture whose trans isomer is pharmacologically inactive, and the depot is cis(Z)-flupentixol decanoate. The panel is therefore the active cis(Z) isomer's; Phase 29 must take the oral isomer ratio into account when converting dose to active-isomer exposure",
